+
+            <div class="matrix26-alert-safe mb-4"><i class="bi bi-file-earmark-lock-fill"></i><div><strong>Restricted reading</strong><p>Matrix26 only searches for log extensions inside <code>logs/</code> and <code>runtime-clients/</code>. Arbitrary paths and files outside the project are blocked.</p></div></div>
+
+            <section class="matrix26-panel">
